ist felicitation","Official participation certificates and mementos distribution","Special honours for emerging and specially-abled creators","Partner and sponsor recognition"],"imageUrl":"/media/installation.jpeg"},{"id":"closing","number":"05","title":"Grand Closing Ceremony & Wrap-Up","timeframe":"Final Day · 6:30 PM – 8:30 PM","audience":["For Artists","For Visitors","For VIPs & Partners"],"introduction":"The final moments bring the community together and prepare the way for the next city edition.","activities":["Closing keynote address","Final collector purchases and direct artist settlements","Safe artwork packing and de-installation assistance","Announcement of the next city edition: Indore · Mumbai · Pune · Bengaluru"],"imageUrl":"/media/live-mural.jpeg"}]',
